{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat lab/tests/screen1.json | head -100; cat lab/tests/mem1.json | head -80; cat decisions/D027-hybrid-split-protocol.md; cat artifacts/codexR/hot-sets/n18.json | head -45'","aggregated_output":"{\n \"tg_ctrl\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"env\": {},\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"10\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n },\n \"tg_graphopt\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"env\": {\n   \"GGML_CUDA_GRAPH_OPT\": \"1\"\n  },\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"10\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n },\n \"tg_nographs\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"env\": {\n   \"GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_GRAPHS\": \"1\"\n  },\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"10\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n }\n}{\n \"mem_tg_bf16\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"model_file\": \"granite-3.1-1b-a400m-instruct-bf16.gguf\",\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"5\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n },\n \"mem_tg_q8\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"model_file\": \"granite-3.1-1b-a400m-instruct-Q8_0.gguf\",\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"5\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n },\n \"mem_tg_q4km\": {\n  \"tool\": \"llama-bench\",\n  \"parser\": \"bench_json\",\n  \"model_file\": \"granite-3.1-1b-a400m-instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf\",\n  \"args\": [\n   \"-p\",\n   \"0\",\n   \"-n\",\n   \"128\",\n   \"-r\",\n   \"5\",\n   \"-o\",\n   \"json\",\n   \"-ngl\",\n   \"99\"\n  ]\n }\n}# D027 — T-R hybrid expert split (hot experts GPU / cold experts CPU-computed) — protocol frozen BEFORE GPU results\nCandidate: cc/hybrid_split/hybrid-split.patch sha256 1063ac10... (Codex T-R; CPU-only evidence: 64/64 greedy tokens, max logit diff 0 for n18/n12/n6 on CPU). Image hsplit-1 (Build CC, NO_VMM, + test-backend-ops, test-hybrid-split).\nModels: granite-split-n{18,12,6}.gguf (hot expert payload incl. 24 null experts = same expert bytes as static --n-cpu-moe n{18,12,6}); hot sets ranked on PROSE PREFILL trace f8a108be (positions 0-1559) -> chat DECODE test is held-out (different prompt and phase).\nStep 1 (engagement + correctness, untimed): test-hybrid-split --backend CUDA0 passes; test-backend-ops GET_ROWS i32 passes; split run decodes; greedy text vs reference recorded. Expected text: mixed-device numerics (cold experts on CPU) may differ from both all-GPU (950b46b1) and all-CPU-expert (76dc9422) fingerprints — text identity is NOT required; quality gate = KLD/top-1 vs bf16/all-GPU reference on wikitext (D010 tool) must be no worse than static nX at the same footprint (both mix CPU/GPU expert numerics).\nStep 2 (timed, one job, SAME hsplit-1 binary, lab/tests/hsplit1.json, order artifacts/x2/hsplit1-order.txt: 9 configs x 3 alternating rounds; host-load monitored, no concurrent compiles/CPU inference): static nX (D022 flags), static nX + --no-op-offload --no-repack (flag control), split nX (-ot '\\.cold$=CPU' --no-op-offload --no-repack). Measure decode t/s median, prefill t/s, nvidia-smi GPU delta MiB.\nAcceptance for \"full-engine improvement at equal GPU memory\": split nX decode median > max(static nX, staticflags nX) median by >= 5% (beyond the ~3% repeat spread seen in D022) AND GPU delta MiB within +3% of static nX AND quality gate passes. Otherwise: reject or inconclusive, reported with numbers. Classification if accepted: runtime-placement mechanism implemented as engine code (expert-granular, admission-free), discrete RTX 5070 Ti only, prose-trained hot set evaluated on chat decode.\nAMENDMENT 1 (before any timed result, 22:59Z): step-1 found (a) llama-completion SIGSEGV/GGML_ASSERT \"tensor not allocated\" in sched_reserve during common_fit_params (patch reads ID-map tensor contents at graph build; auto-fit builds graphs before weights load) -> workaround `--fit off` added to hs_split_* AND hs_staticflags_* tests (static D022-flag tests unchanged; with explicit -ngl 99 fit already aborts as no-op). (b) test-hybrid-split --backend CUDA0: many PASS then \"FAIL: split scalar reference mismatch\" (rc=1) -> correctness on CUDA NOT established; timed numbers are reported as exploratory until (b) is resolved (delegated, T-R2). Untimed engagement: split-n12 decodes 160 t/s, text sha 3190ad82 (distinct from all-GPU 950b46b1 and all-CPU-expert 76dc9422).\n{\n  \"alignment\": 128,\n  \"budget_bytes\": 149520384,\n  \"capacity\": 168,\n  \"engine_bank_bytes\": 149520384,\n  \"evaluation\": \"excluded from ranking; use disjoint sequences or positions outside TRAIN\",\n  \"expert_bank_strides\": [\n    294912,\n    294912,\n    294912\n  ],\n  \"layers\": 24,\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"scope\": \"one GPU, one homogeneous expert-layout group; 32 experts, top-8\",\n  \"selected_experts\": 168,\n  \"selected_payload_bytes\": 148635648,\n  \"tie_break\": \"frequency descending, layer ascending, expert ascending\",\n  \"trace_sha256\": \"f8a108bed6c2d086779f63837b9a330f1d3ac64ab4e471d08f433035815b9489\",\n  \"train\": {\n    \"phase\": \"prefill\",\n    \"pos_end_exclusive\": 1560,\n    \"pos_start_inclusive\": 0,\n    \"seqs\": [\n      0\n    ]\n  },\n  \"train_hits\": 128637,\n  \"train_records\": 37440,\n  \"train_requests\": 299520,\n  \"unobserved_experts\": \"not selected; allocated spare slots remain empty\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
